# Workspace Constraints
This project is part of a larger workspace that uses a **global shared Python virtual environment**.
DO NOT create local `.venv` or `venv` folders.

You MUST use the global environment:
Path: `/home/epmq/Desktop/Projects/shared-venv/bin/python`
Activation: `source /home/epmq/Desktop/Projects/shared-venv/bin/activate`

For more details, refer to `.agents/workflows/shared_venv_policy.md`.
